// GS-Interop: spawn() is domain World (see intrinsics.def). Compiled
// with --domains core (no World access, e.g. a hypothetical
// non-gameplay host's capability profile), this must fail with
// CEL2023. Compiled with --domains core,world (or no --domains flag at
// all, i.e. the real default IntrinsicDomainSet::All()), this must
// type-check cleanly -- proving the default is genuinely unchanged
// behavior, not just documented as such. See
// Language/tests/run_domain_diag_test.cmake / run_domain_ok_test.cmake.
func main() {
    spawn();
}
